note [E++ 1.5a1: the Python library runs real Python from E++]
add the "Python" library

note [1. One line of Python:]
run the python code "print('Hello from Python!')"

note [2. A whole Python block:]
run the python code:
for I in range 3:
   print("Counting in Python:", I)

note [3. E++ variables are visible inside Python:]
let 'Greeting' be "Welcome to E++ and Python"
run the python code "print(greeting.upper())"

say "And now E++ is talking again."
